error[V0303]: `change` may change `s`, but `s` is a name bound by a pattern, so it cannot be changed; to change it, first make a changeable copy with `let mut s = s;`
  --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0303_match_binding_to_mut_param/main.vr:12:27
   |
12 |         Some(s) => change(s),
   |              -            ^ `change` may change `s`, but `s` is a name bound by a pattern, so it cannot be changed; to change it, first make a changeable copy with `let mut s = s;`
   |              |
   |              `s` is bound here
   |
help: replace `change(s)` with `{ let mut s = s; change(s) }`
